      .  0000:  49 00 00 00 00 00 28 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  I.....(.........
      .  0010:  50 7e 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  P~..............
      .  0020:  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00                          ........
    
